Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.95,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Incredible scenes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不可思议的一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.00,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}9{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.85,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}上海大师赛第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.85,0:00:13.53,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fs78}21{\fs68}岁的外卡球员周意 对阵穆塞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:16.21,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}首盘抢七{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:19.31,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}周意连救{\fs78}3{\fs68}个盘点 追到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:22.27,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}接下来 盘点来到他这一边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:32.77,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I love that play.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我喜欢这样的打法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:34.00,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's gutsy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真有胆量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:37.20,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}的盘点 周意跟着发球上网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:39.50,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}用截击收下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:51.25,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he did do it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他真的做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:53.39,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he made it happen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他把机会变成了现实
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:56.01,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fs78}9{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} 周意先下一城
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:00:57.21,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.02,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}他的发球局又遇到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.12,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I can't believe it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:41.36,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You cannot believe he's missed it wide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N难以置信 他竟然打偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:43.45,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}这一个破发点救了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:45.46,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}但这一局最终失守
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:48.90,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 接下来是穆塞蒂的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:51.93,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Break points he had to save{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他必须救下那些破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:53.32,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}right at the beginning of the set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就在这一盘刚开始时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:04.20,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}被扳平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:07.24,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}决胜盘 周意连救{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:09.56,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}抢七里 他再次顶到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:11.78,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}伸拍挡回对手来球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:20.82,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No way!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:37.93,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}两个抢七 周意都赢了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:40.19,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fs78}14{\fs68}个{\fs78}ACE{\fs68} 没有双误
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:42.24,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}下一轮面对胡尔卡奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.31,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}他能再过一关吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:55.59,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Incredible scenes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不可思议的一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:03:01.14,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The best win of his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他职业生涯最棒的一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:03.89,TL,,0,0,235,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The first top 30 win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首次击败世界前三十球员
